* alhar2.a - ALHAR2.MAC translated by tools/m65to09.py (model B), hand-finished here (src/).
* Each line ends with the 6502 source line it comes from.
* The IRQ, called by the platform's frame loop once a virtual 246 Hz IRQ (frame.a), after it has
* filled the input shadows: HW_0C00 (IN1), HW_60C8 (ALLPOT), HW_60D8 (ALLPO2).  The 6502's stack
* and frame-overrun check and its reset (ALHAR2:45-52) are gone: the loop runs a game frame whenever
* FRTIMR reaches 9, so it cannot overrun, and there is no reset to go to.  RTI is RTS.
CHKSMA
